# S1.4 / B0b Layer2 run artifacts.
# Timestamped per-run reports (<timestamp>.json) are NOT tracked — they are
# machine/run-specific. The established baseline (_reference.json) IS tracked
# so the -5%pt completion-rate gate has a committed reference to compare against.
*.json
!_reference.json
# scratch/review artifacts produced by a run (console log, human-readable dumps)
*.txt
*.log
